<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The themed-icon layer for Android 13+.

  This is NOT the foreground with its colours swapped. The system renders this
  layer as a single-tint alpha mask, so the dial face MUST be omitted entirely:
  including it would flatten the ring, markers, hands and crown into one solid
  tinted disc with no watch visible in it. What remains is the same geometry
  drawn as an outline — which is why this is authored artwork rather than an
  export setting.

  Colour is irrelevant beyond its alpha; opaque white is the convention.
-->
